    "body": "Additional measurement from a parallel verification (#265, closed as duplicate): on the seed-30 drifting-MCV input, 4095 samples reports Assessed 3.1935004713512094 with MultiMCW skipped; 4096 samples runs it (C = 1114, r = 6, N = 4033, P_global' = 0.29435912690753879, min entropy 1.7643507342993501, which becomes the Assessed figure). An independent §6.3.7 implementation, which agrees with the tool at 4096 and 4200 samples to 3e-6, gives 1.7652 for the refused 4095-sample file. So the skipped estimate is the minimum there, by a factor of 1.8.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
